11. Important Linux Account Files
/etc/passwd

Contains account information for Linux users.

cat /etc/passwd

Information can include:

Username
UID
GID
Home directory
Login shell
/etc/group

Contains group information and group membership data.

cat /etc/group
/etc/shadow

Contains password-related authentication information, including password hashes and account-aging information.

Access to this file is normally restricted.

